{"id":"nagrada","lemma":"награда","pos":"noun","rank":2630,"glosses":["reward (something of value given in return for an act)","award","decoration"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/61/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"награды","plural":"награды"},"examples":[{"text":"Он заслуживает награды.","en":"He deserves the prize.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,null]},{"text":"За наши головы назначена награда.","en":"There's a price on our heads.","words":[{"g":"behind / for"},{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},{"g":"head","l":"голова"},null,null]},{"text":"Каждый из них удостоился награды.","en":"Each of them was given a prize.","words":[{"g":"every, each"},{"g":"from / out of"},null,null,null]},{"text":"Я заслуживаю награды.","en":"I deserve the prize.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null]},{"text":"Ты заслуживаешь награды.","en":"You deserve a prize.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,null]}]}